+ "VRGDG_Music3TuningPreset": {
+  "attrs": {
+   "accept_all_inputs": false,
+   "category": "VRGDG/Audio/MiniMax Music 3",
+   "description": "Behavior-based presets for adherence, structure, variation, stability, plan strength, rendering detail, and speed. These remain independent from genre/style captions.",
+   "display_name": "VRGDG Music3 Tuning Presets",
+   "enable_expand": false,
+   "essentials_category": null,
+   "has_intermediate_output": false,
+   "is_api_node": false,
+   "is_deprecated": false,
+   "is_dev_only": false,
+   "is_experimental": false,
+   "is_input_list": false,
+   "is_output_node": false,
+   "loop_boundary": null,
+   "node_id": "VRGDG_Music3TuningPreset",
+   "not_idempotent": false,
+   "price_badge": null,
+   "search_aliases": []
+  },
+  "hidden": [],
+  "inputs": [
+   {
+    "attrs": {
+     "advanced": null,
+     "control_after_generate": null,
+     "default": "Balanced / Built-in Baseline",
+     "display_name": null,
+     "extra_dict": {},
+     "force_input": null,
+     "id": "preset",
+     "image_folder": null,
+     "lazy": null,
+     "multiselect": false,
+     "optional": false,
+     "options": [
+      "Balanced / Built-in Baseline",
+      "Balanced Quality",
+      "Raw Live Rock",
+      "Lyrics + Structure Focus",
+      "Creative Variations",
+      "Intimate + Dry",
+      "Aggressive + Dense",
+      "Conservative / Stable",
+      "Strict Lyrics",
+      "Strong Song Structure",
+      "Creative Melody",
+      "Maximum Arrangement Variation",
+      "Stable / Low Artifact",
+      "Strong Acoustic Plan",
+      "Loose Acoustic Plan",
+      "Detailed Rendering",
+      "Long-Song Stability",
+      "Fast Draft",
+      "High-Energy / Dense",
+      "Soft / Restrained"
+     ],
+     "rawLink": null,
+     "remote": null,
+     "socketless": null,
+     "tooltip": "Caption presets choose WHAT style to request. Tuning presets choose HOW Music3 interprets it.\n\nBalanced / Built-in Baseline: Neutral reference using Music3's familiar starting values. Expect balanced adherence and variation without pushing any stage; use this before judging another preset.\nBalanced Quality: Adds rendering steps and slightly tightens planning. Tends to sound a little more finished and deliberate while remaining broadly balanced.\nRaw Live Rock: Firm planning and stronger diffusion guidance with moderate plan emphasis. Tends toward decisive, energetic, punchy results; may become slightly rougher than baseline.\nLyrics + Structure Focus: Tighter AR choices and stronger text guidance. Tends to follow words and section labels more closely, with somewhat less melodic and arrangement freedom.\nCreative Variations: Looser guidance, high planning diversity and gentler rendering. Tends to explore different melodies, phrasing and arrangements; lyrics or structure may wander more.\nIntimate + Dry: Strong caption guidance, constrained planning and restrained diffusion. Tends toward focused, simpler and less explosive results that leave more room around the lead.\nAggressive + Dense: Higher diversity, rendering guidance, steps and plan strength. Tends toward thicker, more forceful and busier results; carries greater harshness or artifact risk.\nConservative / Stable: Constrained planning with lower diffusion and plan strength. Tends to produce steadier, cleaner and less adventurous results when stronger presets become unstable.\nStrict Lyrics: The strongest lyric guidance with the narrowest token choice. Tends to prioritize word and line adherence; may sound more rigid or less inventive.\nStrong Song Structure: High AR guidance, low diversity, extra steps and stronger plan emphasis. Tends to make verses, choruses and transitions more deliberate; may reduce spontaneity.\nCreative Melody: Low AR guidance with high token diversity and moderate rendering. Tends to produce more surprising melodies and vocal phrasing while still retaining a usable structure.\nMaximum Arrangement Variation: The loosest and most exploratory preset. Tends to create the largest changes in instrumentation, pacing and section treatment; has the highest drift risk.\nStable / Low Artifact: Constrained planning, restrained diffusion and reduced plan strength with extra steps. Tends to favor smooth, reliable rendering over impact or novelty.\nStrong Acoustic Plan: Emphasizes a fairly focused hidden music plan during diffusion. Tends to sound decisive and tightly committed to the generated arrangement; excessive emphasis can sound harsh.\nLoose Acoustic Plan: High planning diversity with low text, diffusion and plan strength. Tends to feel freer, softer and less locked-in; melody, lyrics and sections may drift.\nDetailed Rendering: Keeps baseline composition behavior but raises diffusion steps substantially. Tends to refine texture and separation rather than rewrite the composition; slower to generate.\nLong-Song Stability: Tighter planning, stronger text guidance and more rendering steps. Intended to help longer songs remain coherent across sections; may repeat ideas or feel less spontaneous.\nFast Draft: Uses only 20 rendering steps with otherwise moderate controls. Useful for quickly testing lyrics, captions and seeds; expect less refinement than a final render.\nHigh-Energy / Dense: Strong diffusion, more steps, elevated diversity and plan emphasis. Tends toward louder-feeling, layered and high-impact arrangements; increased congestion or artifact risk.\nSoft / Restrained: Focused AR planning with gentle diffusion and slightly reduced plan strength. Tends toward calmer dynamics, lighter density and less aggressive rendering.",
+     "upload": null,
+     "widget_type": null
+    },
+    "io_type": "COMBO",
+    "kind": "standard"
+   }
+  ],
+  "outputs": [
+   {
+    "attrs": {
+     "display_name": "ar_cfg_scale",
+     "id": "output_0",
+     "is_output_list": false,
+     "tooltip": "Connect to Music3 Text Encode cfg_scale. Higher follows caption/lyrics more strongly while generating the AR plan."
+    },
+    "io_type": "FLOAT",
+    "kind": "standard"
+   },
+   {
+    "attrs": {
+     "display_name": "ar_top_k",
+     "id": "output_1",
+     "is_output_list": false,
+     "tooltip": "Connect to Music3 Text Encode top_k. Lower is more constrained/repeatable; higher explores more token alternatives."
+    },
+    "io_type": "INT",
+    "kind": "standard"
+   },
+   {
+    "attrs": {
+     "display_name": "sampler_cfg",
+     "id": "output_2",
+     "is_output_list": false,
+     "tooltip": "Connect to KSampler cfg. Controls denoiser guidance between the acoustic plan and zeroed conditioning."
+    },
+    "io_type": "FLOAT",
+    "kind": "standard"
+   },
+   {
+    "attrs": {
+     "display_name": "steps",
+     "id": "output_3",
